# Put the flake's toolchain on PATH whenever you enter this directory, so editors
# and rust-analyzer use the same rustc/cargo as `nix develop` and CI.
#
# Needed because the rustup toolchain on some systems (NixOS in particular) has a
# broken rustc shim: rust-analyzer then starts with no sysroot and reports errors
# that `cargo check` doesn't have.
#
# Run `direnv allow` once to enable it.
use flake
